Package: predatortune
Version: 2.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.2), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.8), lm-sensors, dkms, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Recommends: linux-headers-generic
Maintainer: Madhav <madhav@meowdev>
Description: Fan & thermal control for Acer Predator laptops on Linux
 PredatorTune is a native GTK4/Adwaita thermal control application for Acer
 Predator laptops running Linux. It provides real-time temperature and fan
 monitoring, and performance mode switching via kernel platform_profile.
 .
 A system daemon drives both fans from a configurable temperature curve
 automatically from boot, and a tray indicator shows the current temperature
 in the top bar. The WMI fan-speed kernel module is built through DKMS, so it
 is rebuilt for every kernel upgrade.
Homepage: https://github.com/0xshubhs/predatur
